AT n=0: f(0) = (0-2+sqrt(4))/2 = (0-2+2)/2 = 0/2 = 0
AT n=1: f(1) = (1-2+sqrt(5))/2 = (-1+sqrt(5))/2 = phi - 1 = 1/phi
  Wait: (-1+sqrt(5))/2 = 0.6180339887 = 1/phi = phi-1. YES!
