PART 4: f(n) AS THE DOMINANT EIGENVALUE OF A 2x2 SYSTEM AT SCALE n
======================================================================

The formula f(n) = (n-2+sqrt(n^2+4))/2... wait, the user wrote
(n-2+sqrt(n^2+4))/2, not (n-2+sqrt((n-2)^2+4))/2.

Let me recheck: (n-2+sqrt(n^2+4))/2.

